# FORKNEWS - changes carried by this fork

This file records changes made in this fork that are not (yet) part of
upstream GNU GSL.  It is deliberately separate from `NEWS`, which is
upstream's release log and should only be touched for changes that are
intended to go upstream.

Each entry is tagged with its intended disposition:

  [upstream]   intended to be submitted or kept suitable for upstream GSL;
               written in the style upstream would accept.
  [fork]       specific to this fork and not intended for upstream, e.g. an
               alternative build system or CI setup that upstream does not
               want to maintain.
  [rejected]   a patch that was evaluated and deliberately not applied, kept
               for the record with the reason.

A change may start as `[fork]` and be promoted to `[upstream]` later; when an
entry is actually merged upstream, remove it from here and add it to `NEWS`
if appropriate.

Upstream branch at the time of writing: savannah/master (2.8+).


